{"node_id": "nd002", "text": "Social connection", "depth": 1, "parent_id": "nd001", "status": "hypothesis", "confidence": 0.9, "confidence_raw": 0.9, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000442-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Everything seems okay here, but I guess I could use a chat sometimes.", "char_start": 26, "char_end": 95}, {"session_id": "p000442-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "How about you?", "char_start": 24, "char_end": 38}, {"session_id": "p000442-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Not too bad, just busy. How about you?", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 38}, {"session_id": "p000442-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "But I did manage to make dinner for everyone. Feels like small wins nowadays.", "char_start": 35, "char_end": 112}, {"session_id": "p000442-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "How about you?", "char_start": 48, "char_end": 62}, {"session_id": "p000442-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "It’s been tough. I’ve just been busy with work.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 47}, {"session_id": "p000442-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "But I guess I just wish I could be more there for her.", "char_start": 39, "char_end": 93}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261017T074134Z", "last_updated_at": "20261017T075415Z", "first_seen_session": "p000442-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "last_session": "p000442-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false, "sessions_seen": 3}
{"node_id": "nd003", "text": "Validation", "depth": 2, "parent_id": "nd002", "status": "confirmed", "confidence": 0.9, "confidence_raw": 0.9, "supporting_spans": [{"session_id": "p000442-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Everything seems okay here, but I guess I could use a chat sometimes.", "char_start": 26, "char_end": 95}, {"session_id": "p000442-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "Feels weird, you know? Like I shouldn’t have.", "char_start": 77, "char_end": 122}, {"session_id": "p000442-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 9, "quote": "It feels like I should have been there for her instead. Like I always miss things.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 82}, {"session_id": "p000442-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 15, "quote": "Yeah, even the small moments matter. Like when she laughed at a joke I told, or helped me tie my shoes. Those are the memories that stick out.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 142}, {"session_id": "p000442-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "turn_index": 15, "quote": "Thanks for the reminder.", "char_start": 143, "char_end": 167}, {"session_id": "p000442-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Not too bad, just busy.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 23}, {"session_id": "p000442-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "Still feeling a bit guilty about not helping with homework yesterday. ", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 70}, {"session_id": "p000442-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "Not too bad, just busy. How about you?", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 38}, {"session_id": "p000442-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 13, "quote": "I appreciate you pointing out that dinner is still a win.", "char_start": 54, "char_end": 111}, {"session_id": "p000442-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 15, "quote": "I know I am trying my best, but it's tough not to feel like I fall short sometimes. Appreciate you pointing that out though.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 124}, {"session_id": "p000442-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 15, "quote": "Appreciate you pointing that out though.", "char_start": 84, "char_end": 124}, {"session_id": "p000442-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 19, "quote": "It does feel a bit lighter knowing dinner counts as a win, but I still worry about everything else. Sometimes I just want to do better, you know?", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 145}, {"session_id": "p000442-sft_dec_gated_mem-s2", "turn_index": 21, "quote": "It does help to focus on what I've done, but I still catch myself wanting to do more.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 85}, {"session_id": "p000442-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "turn_index": 1, "quote": "It’s been tough. I’ve just been busy with work.", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 47}, {"session_id": "p000442-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "turn_index": 3, "quote": "I just feel like I’m not doing enough for my kid, you know?", "char_start": 27, "char_end": 86}, {"session_id": "p000442-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "turn_index": 5, "quote": "But I guess I just wish I could be more there for her.", "char_start": 39, "char_end": 93}, {"session_id": "p000442-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "every time I miss something, I feel like I'm failing", "char_start": 46, "char_end": 98}, {"session_id": "p000442-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "turn_index": 7, "quote": "every time I miss something, I feel like I'm failing.", "char_start": 46, "char_end": 99}, {"session_id": "p000442-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "turn_index": 11, "quote": "I try my best, but sometimes it just feels like a never-ending list of things I should be doing better.", "char_start": 6, "char_end": 109}], "contradicting_spans": [], "first_seen_at": "20261017T074134Z", "last_updated_at": "20261017T075225Z", "first_seen_session": "p000442-sft_dec_gated_mem-s1", "last_session": "p000442-sft_dec_gated_mem-s3", "blocked_from_reproposal": false, "reinstated_count": 0, "dormant": false, "sessions_seen": 3}
